<title>UK: TABLE - Devro pretax profits higher.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Devro pretax profits higher.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Annual results to December 31.</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		18.5		   vs 17.4</p>
<p> Shr pre-exceptionals   19.7		   vs 17.4</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	  5.7		   vs  5.1</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence)  8.5		   vs  7.7</p>
<p> Pretax		     51.9		   vs 31.1</p>
<p> Turnover		  302.21		  vs 97.78</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name - Sausage skin maker Devro Plc said pretax profit was after a restructuring charge of 10.5 million for the integration of Teepak, as announced in March, a 4.5 million exceptional cost for stock write-offs in relation to BSE or 'mad cow' disease, and a 7.5 million exceptional gain on the sale of Devro America for 16.8 million in August.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
